none.description:
{Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit with such fear that it becomes incapable of action.

The target enemy unit skips its next turn, has its Speed reduced by 20%, and has a 10% chance to become stricken with Fear every turn.

basic.description:
{Basic Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit with such fear that it becomes incapable of action.

The target enemy unit skips its next turn, has its Speed reduced by 20%, and has a 10% chance to become stricken with Fear every turn.

advanced.description:
{Advanced Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit with such fear that it becomes incapable of action.

The target enemy unit skips its next turn, has its Speed reduced by 40%, and has a 15% chance to become stricken with Fear every turn.

expert.description:
{Expert Fear}

Strikes an enemy unit and any enemy units adjacent to the target with such fear that they become incapable of action.

The affected targets skip their next turns, have their Speed reduced by 60%, and have a 20% chance to become stricken with Fear every turn.
